			"notes": "### Changed / 变更\n- Merged `1.20.1/Forge` and `1.20.2/Forge` into unified `1.20.x/Forge`\n- 合并 `1.20.1/Forge` 和 `1.20.2/Forge` 为统一的 `1.20.x/Forge`\n- Supports Minecraft 1.20.1 - 1.20.6 all versions\n- 支持 Minecraft 1.20.1 - 1.20.6 所有版本\n\n### Added / 新增\n- Added `1.21.x/Forge` directory, supports MC 1.21 - 1.21.11\n- 新增 `1.21.x/Forge` 目录，支持 MC 1.21 - 1.21.11\n- Upgraded Java toolchain to Java 21 (1.21.x version)\n- 升级 Java 工具链至 Java 21（1.21.x 版本）\n- Adapted to ForgeGradle 6.x new API\n- 适配 ForgeGradle 6.x 新 API\n\n### Fixed / 修复\n- Fixed `setRoomCode` method not found in `Config.java`\n- 修复 `Config.java` 中 `setRoomCode` 方法不存在的问题\n- Fixed compilation errors caused by 1.21 API changes\n- 修复 1.21 API 变化导致的编译错误\n  - Removed `FMLJavaModLoadingContext` constructor parameter\n  - 移除 `FMLJavaModLoadingContext` 构造函数参数\n  - Changed to `ModLoadingContext.get()` for config registration\n  - 改用 `ModLoadingContext.get()` 注册配置\n  - Fixed `renderBackground` method signature\n  - 修复 `renderBackground` 方法签名\n  - Removed `reobfJar` task (no longer needed for 1.21)\n  - 移除 `reobfJar` 任务（1.21 不再需要）"
